{"seq":2,"slug":"designs","title":"设计","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/experimental-design-doe/designs","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"factorial-designs","title":"析因设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/experimental-design-doe/designs/factorial-designs","wordCount":1787,"readingTime":8},{"seq":2,"slug":"fractional-factorial","title":"部分析因","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/experimental-design-doe/designs/fractional-factorial","wordCount":1677,"readingTime":7},{"seq":3,"slug":"blocking-confounding","title":"区组与混杂","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/experimental-design-doe/designs/blocking-confounding","wordCount":1816,"readingTime":8}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"设计\">设计</h1><p>如果说「基础」章回答了为什么和用什么术语，这一章就是 hub 的骨架——把一个具体问题翻译成一张可执行的试验矩阵。</p>\n<p><a href=\"factorial-designs\">析因设计</a> 是一切的起点：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>2</mn><mi>k</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2^k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 与一般析因把所有因素的所有水平组合都跑一遍，因而能干净地估出每一个主效应和每一阶交互。它是「黄金标准」，也是后面所有简化设计的参照系；交互作用这个 DOE 的核心概念，在本 hub 也以这一篇为主讲处。</p>\n<p>但当因素一多，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>2</mn><mi>k</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2^k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的运行数指数爆炸。<a href=\"fractional-factorial\">部分析因</a> 用「混杂」做交易：只跑全析因的一个规整子集，代价是某些效应被别名（alias）绑在一起。分辨度（resolution）这把尺子告诉你牺牲了什么、换来了几分之一的运行数，是筛选阶段的主力。</p>\n<p>现实里实验很少在均匀环境下一气跑完——不同批次原料、不同机台、不同日期都会引入系统差异。<a href=\"blocking-confounding\">区组与混杂</a> 把「基础」章的区组原理推到设计层面：如何主动把高阶交互混杂到区组上，从而在隔离噪声的同时几乎不损失关心的效应。</p>\n<p>三篇从「全都要」到「按需取舍」再到「与现实噪声共处」，构成一条清晰的设计决策链。读完后你应能为给定的因素数、运行预算和精度要求，挑出恰当的设计；如何从这些设计的数据里提取结论，则交给下一章「分析」。</p>\n"}